  "baseline_commit": "630d835",
  "scope": "Native C++ and installed Python editor now insert_saved_visit/set_saved_visit_position/remove_saved_visit/move_saved_visit/transfer_saved_stage. Historical visits may repeat any admitted TCZ plane. The final live visit and its draft remain protected, and transfers retain complete frozen stages and nonempty historical source visits. Moving a whole visit or removing it is explicit. All candidates pass full geometry/record/resource admission before immutable state replacement without source reads. Shared C++/Python ImGui Plane visits controls list/select history, edit T/C/Z, insert an identity visit with captured current selection, reposition/order/remove it, and transfer selected saved adjustments to another visit without navigating or publishing. Existing saved-stage editing authors the inserted identity. Two hundred thirty-eight new installed cases cover seven components, all axes, order-sensitive repeated visits (128 versus149), reposition/removal/destination pixels, frozen transfer, protected live intent, invalid addressing/types/positions/empty membership, budget refusal, strict JSON replay, complete recording and paired Undo/Redo. Windows/Linux each pass 6583 installed Python checks, six native groups, an installed public SDK consumer and three standalone UI probes, zero failure/error/skip. Native UI physically exercises transfer, visit list selection, insertion, earlier/later order, real T/C/Z fields and position update/removal on each axis. Initial build sessions disappeared; authoritative process inspection found no surviving task build, and Linux had restarted with a hangup log. Fresh qualification reused retained caches without claiming interrupted runs passed. Native qualification002 passed the model but its UI click driver stopped at a partially clipped insertion button: observed center y785.5, visible flag true and no admission error. Driver003 scrolls centers into the safe viewport before clicking, leaving production unchanged; bounded diagnostic report and exact failed test variants remain. Final003 passes full native/UI/SDK/Python qualification and source seals. Final product/header identities are rechecked. Actual disposable venv interpreters import installed modules; no Python product processing. Owned environments/pytest/native fixtures/SDK intermediates are CRC/every-member-SHA archived before confined cleanup; final installs/carriers/examples/probes/reports/logs and useful caches remain. No dependency, original99 scope/status triple or old acceptance record change. The existing historical Auto producer fingerprint failure remains open, along with broader real canvas/navigation/Auto/Reset and full ImageJ/Fiji/platform/resource acceptance.",
